      ],
      "title": "巨人国探险？·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "21035001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "这……这这这这！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "这这这这！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "不会有错的！我们终于抵达了，传闻中的——巨人的宝库！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "即使是跟收集了人间所有的宝物的吉尔伽美相比，也是一点都不输给他呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "这一件宝贝！没猜错的话！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "正是传说中著名的诗歌《尼伯龙根之歌》中尼伯龙根所持的魔剑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "要是稍微触碰一下，呀！AI就会立刻消失的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "还有这一件！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "如果大侦探爱酱的记忆仍旧清醒，那么它——是曾经直播过的游戏：三国的无双猛将吕布手持的方天画戟！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "那里！还有轻小说和漫画作者亲笔签名的收藏书籍！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "是超有名幻想之国！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "不仅如此！还有还有！那件网球！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "那件宝物……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "那件印有爱酱的宝物！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "那件正在赛场上用网球拍全力挥洒汗水的矫健形象的爱酱！果然也被拿去当做研究了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "哎呀，超级聪明的天才AI要被海洋一般的压力给冲走了，呜呜呜",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "原来如此，那个巨人果然是冲着我来的嘛！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "等等！难道说，从一开始的探索，爱酱就已经迈入巨人计算好的陷阱里吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035019",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "弹幕？弹幕上的大家在说什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035020",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "没有错，局势现在对爱酱非常不利！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035021",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "诶诶诶？！「性感的姐姐」「好喜欢性感的姐姐」？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035022",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "大家！弹幕上的大家到底在说什么胡话呀！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035023",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "身后？爱酱的身后？发生什么了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21035024",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "你们是说……我的身后……有？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-423",
      "sourceRefs": [
