      "title": "巨人国探险？·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "21045001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "呼哧……呼……呼呼……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "跑快一点！那个奇奇怪怪的女人要追上来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "等一等！请等一等！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "加大码率！朝右给我使劲的开！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "左边！知道了知道了！在左边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "欸不对！是右边吗？她真的好快，趁着遥控车一眨眼的功夫就消失的无影无踪了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "呼哧呼哧……大家，这并不是一期立志于减肥的美少女直播呀！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "到底是……左边……还是右边……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "气喘吁吁，完全要跑不动了！不行啊！我要休息一会。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "Kizuna AI就这样倒在了鲜花盛开的草地中。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045011",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "太快了，跑得太快啦！姐姐为什么要逃跑呀！一定是巨人！一定是巨人太可怕了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045012",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "这里是爱酱巨人国探险的直播！营救性感姐姐的计划还在进行，但是我需要先休息一下！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045013",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "哇，话说，真惬意呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045014",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "好香的味道！大家知道这叫什么花吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045015",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "嗯……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045016",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "这些花朵的名字都听起来都好美呀！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045017",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "有什么意思包含在里面吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045018",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "哇……真的好漂亮，已经忘记要做什么了，如果可以的话，想暂时忘掉一些，永远永远的躺在这里呀！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045019",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "拂面而过的微风，轻轻摇曳的花朵，不知道为什么，在这里时候，心里感觉格外的放松。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045020",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "咦？大家生活的也是这样的世界吗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045021",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "突然有些羡慕起大家了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045022",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "爱酱，因为是人工AI的原因，总是活动在白色的虚拟空间里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045023",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "大家！如果可以的话，能够多多亲近自然，与自然相处，是一件多么有趣的事情呀！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045024",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "所以有空的话，不妨放下手机和电脑，多多去郊野和鲜花与树木待在一起。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "那个女人已经躺在那里多久了？我快被这个喋喋不休的女人逼疯了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "遥控车",
          "text": "（小声）狩猎者大人，已经过去半个钟头了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "不行，这样拖下去，那些手办就要回来了，那我们的捕捉人类的计划就要放弃了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "现在我们该怎么出去？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "遥控车",
          "text": "狩猎者大人，我们直接用武力逼迫她就范！就像调教我们那样，您也可以……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21045030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我现在已经被吵到头痛了，总而言之，我要你现在冲出去，载着她离开，最好离我越远越好……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
