      "title": "巨人国探险？·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "21050001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我说的没错！其实红兔子也很可爱！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "噗嗤！真不愧是优纪前辈。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "上传好了。希望这些照片能为主人赢得特别的Kizuna AI手办。或者能和爱酱一起直播，也再好不过了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "桌上的，是新的手办盒子吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "咦，好像就是那款Kizuna AI手办。。所以！我们果然！中！奖！了？！快递好快啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "快快快快！快去看看！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "咦……可是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "盒子里是空的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！你们快点住手呀！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "是门外发出的声音，快去看看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "呜呜呜……快点放我下来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "很好，就这样左右行驶，一直保持下去。起码能让这个奇怪的女人少说几句话。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "狩猎者！你为什么会在这里！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "快看那里，是Kizuna AI！是直播里的Kizuna AI前辈！你们要伤害爱酱前辈吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21050015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "红兔子呢？那个人类的手办回来了，为什么它还没有来汇报。算了，果然是不可靠的家伙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21055001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "看来与那个人类共度良宵的计划要泡汤了，好不爽啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21055002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "可爱的优纪，还有各位，今天的狩猎到此为止吧，我们走。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21055003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "姐姐！请等一等！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21055004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "你还没有告诉我巨人的信息呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21055005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "不告诉我巨人的弱点我是不会放姐姐走的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21055006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "天哪，妾身要疯了，这个女人清醒过来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21055007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "遥控车",
          "text": "大人，快，我带你离开。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21055008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "她逃跑了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21055009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "追！我们快点追上去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
